{{> Logo this}}

{{!--
  Sent to an account's address when one of its two-factor authentication
  backup codes was spent (Common/Server/Utils/TwoFactorBackupCodeNotification
  .sendCodeUsedEmail): to sign in, the sign-in's second step, or to confirm
  it was them before a change to how they sign in (Confirm It's You, #10219,
  usedToConfirmItsYou). A code works once, so one email per code spent.

  It says what the code was used for; when, in the reader's time zone; how
  many codes are left, and what to do about that (isLastCode, isRunningLow);
  from where (the rows of Partials/RequestOriginFields.hbs, which show only
  what is known); and what to do if it was not them. The codes themselves
  are never in it.

  The product's name goes into a sentence through ttHtml, which escapes the
  whole sentence; the time and the count are values. Everything else is
  OneUptime's own words, looked up in the reader's language
  (Utils/EmailLanguage.ts).
--}}

{{#if usedToConfirmItsYou}}
{{> EmailTitle title=(t "A backup code was used to confirm it's you.") }}

{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "One of your two-factor authentication backup codes was used to confirm it was you, in a session signed in to your {{product}} account. Each backup code works once, so this one is now spent." product=(brandName))}}
{{else}}
{{> EmailTitle title=(t "A backup code was used to sign in to your account.") }}

{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Someone signed in to your {{product}} account with one of your two-factor authentication backup codes. Each backup code works once, so this one is now spent." product=(brandName))}}
{{/if}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Used at:") plainText=usedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Backup codes remaining:") plainText=remainingCodeCount }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{#if isLastCode}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "That was your last backup code. If you lose your authenticator app or security key now, an administrator will have to reset two-factor authentication for you, so make a new set of backup codes as soon as you can.")}}
{{else if isRunningLow}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "You are running low on backup codes. Make a new set under User Profile > Two-factor authentication: it replaces every code you have now.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "You can see how many backup codes you have left, and make a new set, under User Profile > Two-factor authentication.")}}
{{/if}}

{{#if usedToConfirmItsYou}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If this was not you, someone who can sign in to your account knows your password and has your backup codes. Change your password right away, then make a new set of backup codes: a new set replaces every code you have now.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If this was not you, change your password right away, then make a new set of backup codes: a new set replaces every code you have now.")}}
{{/if}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonText=(t "Manage Two-Factor Authentication") buttonUrl=twoFactorAuthUrl }}

{{> SupportBlock this}}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
